		{"id":"514b6fb6418a2cfb","type":"text","text":"![[Pasted image 20260714102100.png]][[Health programmes in India]]\n**Specific Objectives (NHP 2017 & SDG 3):**\n\n1. **Reduce MMR:** Target of less than 70 per 100,000 live births by 2030.\n2. **Reduce IMR:** Target of 28 by 2019 (National target) and significantly lower by 2030.\n3. **Reduce TFR:** Achieve a replacement level of **2.1**.\n4. **Universal Immunization:** Achieve >90% full immunization coverage.\n5. **Skilled Birth Attendance:** Ensure >90% of deliveries are attended by skilled health personnel","x":-612,"y":-180,"width":612,"height":540},
